{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object is in sight, approach and take it. Check properties, do specific task. Otherwise, search.     list of available nodes: <Condition ID = IsObjectInSight    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Action ID = SearchForObject    />\"",
